# Vault Config

User-specific settings for this vault. Claude instances read this file during orientation to find local paths and preferences.

This file is NOT shared — each user maintains their own. It is NOT published to GitHub with the Seed.

## Paths

| Key | Value |
|---|---|
| vault_root | `~/Vaults/Regen Vault` |
| scripts_dir | `_DataWizard/Workshop - DataWizard/Scripts/` (primary; dw_ops, Reddit tools, migrated scripts) |
| scripts_dir_legacy | `~/Library/CloudStorage/Dropbox/Scripts/DataWizard` (pipeline scripts: classify.py, segment_transcript.py; rabbit_whole/) |
| dw_seed_git | `_DataWizard/Seed/` (nested repo, https://github.com/andrewalan11/DataWizard) |
| seed_role | `upstream` (this machine is the Seed source of truth - update_seed.sh refuses to sync or install auto-sync here) |
| ollama_host | `http://localhost:11434` |
| dw_save_logs | active: `~/.datawizard-sync.log` (last 1,000 lines) - full history: `~/.datawizard-sync.log.archive` (rotated, never discarded) - one-time snapshot: `~/.datawizard-sync.log.pre-trim` (63,599 lines, taken 2026-09-06 before the first rotation; S336) - vault copy of that snapshot: `_DataWizard/xArchive - DataWizard/DW Save Log - pre-rotation snapshot 2026-09-06.log` |

