## Garden Sources

Used by the `garden-synthesis` skill to resolve where seeds, gardens, and research layers live. Paths are relative to `vault_root` unless absolute. See `Seed/Skills/garden-synthesis/SKILL.md`.

| Key | Value |
|---|---|
| seed_sources | `_Seeds/`, `_SeedPods/` |
| garden_home | Per-concept folder at vault root -- each garden gets its own `_<Concept>/` folder (e.g. `_Glowing Futures/`, `_SeedsWell/`). Not a central `_Gardens/`. |
| research_layers | 1. local vault (`~/Vaults/Regen Vault`) -> 2. archive/transcript (`~/Documents/Claude/Projects/DataWizard/Recall Vault`) -> 3. web |
| planter | `_DataWizard/Seed/Scripts/plant_garden_seeds.py` (ships with the Seed) |
| companion_base | `_Bases/` (one `.base` per garden, named `<Garden Name>.base`); generator `_DataWizard/Seed/Scripts/generate_garden_base.py` |

